The threat library in src/mcp_security_review/library/ refers to requirement ids
from the OWASP Application Security Verification Standard (ASVS) 5.0.0
(https://github.com/OWASP/ASVS, CC BY-SA 4.0), to ids from the OWASP MCP Top 10 2025
(https://github.com/OWASP/www-project-mcp-top-10, CC BY-SA 4.0), and to MITRE CWE
identifiers (https://cwe.mitre.org). Only identifiers are used; all descriptive text
is original.

